     *
     * @param {boolean} radialSort - Whether using radial sort mode.
     * @param {number} minDist - Minimum distance.
     * @param {number} range - Distance range (maxDist - minDist).
     * @returns {number} The camera bin index (0 to NUM_BINS-1).
