     * @param {boolean} [options.isForward] - Whether the pass is forward.
     * @param {boolean} [options.isShadow] - Whether the pass is shadow.
     * @param {number} [options.lightType] - Type of light, for example `LIGHTTYPE_DIRECTIONAL`.
